Recommends: gnome-themes-more
Description: extra themes originally for the GNOME 2 desktop
 This package includes icon four themes originally contributed for
 the GNOME 2 desktop and configured to work with modern Xfce:
 .
  * Dropline Neu, a flashy and colorful theme resembling Dropline 
    GNOME.
  * Foxtrot, Tango-like icons with Bluecurve-like colour.
  * Gion, an original and sober theme.
  * GNOME Alternative, like the default GNOME 2 theme but with
    more-open folders.
 .
 It also contains two GTK2 + Metacity themes: 
 .
  * Darklooks, a dark version of the standard Clearlooks theme.
  * Unity, a smooth and rounded theme.
